golang-github-golang-jwt-jwt-v5 (5.2.1-1deepin1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Fix CVE-2025-30204: DoS via asymmetric resource consumption in
    ParseUnverified. The function ParseUnverified used strings.Split to
    parse JWT tokens, which could cause O(n) memory allocations with
    malicious input containing many periods. Fixed by replacing with
    strings.Cut based splitToken function.

 -- hudeng <hudeng@deepin.org>  Wed, 29 Apr 2026 12:07:30 +0800

